## Why This Is Asked
This question probes a candidate's ability to architect a production-grade RAG pipeline with chunking, caching, and provenance, not just theory.

## Key Concepts
- Adaptive chunking, deduplication, top-k retrieval, reranking, provenance, TTL cache, observability

## Code Example
```javascript
// Adaptive chunk size based on document type
function pickChunkSize(docType, defaultSize) {
  const map = { manual: 750, guide: 500, article: 300 };
  return map[docType] ?? defaultSize;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you measure retrieval quality and latency in production?
- How would you handle data updates and cache invalidation across shards?

